# Copy to .env to configure a local build. Everything here is optional — the
# site runs, and every page works, with none of it set.

# Where the contact form posts. Any URL that accepts a JSON body of
# { name, email, message } will do: a Formspree form, a Resend-backed
# function, a Worker beside the site.
#
# Unset, the form composes the message and hands it to the visitor's own mail
# client instead, and says so rather than claiming to have sent anything. That
# is the right behaviour for the single-file build, which can be opened from
# disk with no server to post to at all.
# VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
